//22600 - 22880 Tarant Thieves Underground rumors (1130-1144)

{22600}{The Thieves Underground would like me to retrieve some treasure that sank off of Low Dervish Row.}
{22601}{A small ship sank off Low Dervish Row.  It is said that there may be treasure hidden in the waters nearby.  I suspect it would fetch some fine coin on the black market.}

{22620}{The Thieves Underground would like me to retrieve the enchanted looking glass from Mrs. Pettibone's home on Lungsten Road.}
{22621}{I hear that there is an enchanted looking glass hidden away in Mrs. Pettibone's home, over on Lungsten Road.  We have someone interested in obtaining such a remarkable item.}

{22640}{The Thieves Underground would like me to retrieve the bottle of Napha Water from Mrs. Halster's home on Devonshire.}
{22641}{Rumor has it that Mrs. Regina Halster, over on Devonshire, has received a special decanter of Napha Water.  It is said to be one of purest batches of elven perfume created in centuries.  The black market would welcome such a treasure.}

{22660}{The Thieves Underground would like me to retrieve the Essence of Will-o-the-Wisp from Parnell's.}
{22661}{Rumor has it that Parnell's just got in some rare Essence of Will-o-the-Wisp.  It fetches quite a price on the secondary market.}

{22680}{The Thieves Underground would like me to retrieve a vial of venom from the Lethe Wyvern from the Zoological Society.}
{22681}{A patron of the Underground is interested in obtaining a vial of venom from the Lethe Wyvern.  Some say that the zoological society has such rarities in their stores.}

{22700}{The Thieves Underground would like me to retrieve the plans for Schrick's Multi-Barreled Pistol from the Bates Factory.}
{22701}{The Bates Factory has developed secret plans for a new weapon called Schreck's Multi-Barreled Pistol.  We have some buyers that are very interested in this new technology.}

{22720}{The Thieves Underground would like me to retrieve the flawless dwarven rubies rumored to be aboard a ship anchored in Tarant.}
{22721}{I hear that one of the ships in port came laden with a store of flawless dwarven rubies.  We have a party interested in owning such perfection.}

{22740}{The Thieves Underground would like me to retrieve the lucky medallion rumored to be held by one of Poone's vagrants.}
{22741}{It is said that one of the vagrant's over at Poone's has gotten hold of a lucky medallion.  There are many that would pay highly for such a trinket.}

{22760}{The Thieves Underground would like me to retrieve the rare Derian Ka sword from Mr. Appleby's home.}
{22761}{Mr. Appleby has acquired a rare sword from the Derian Ka.  We have another collector that would like it for himself.}

{22780}{The Thieves Underground would like me to retrieve the key that Madam Lil keeps on her person.}
{22781}{Madam Lil keeps a particular key on her person.  Someone we know is very interesting in getting hold of that key.}

{22800}{The Thieves Underground would like me to retrieve the Jewel of Hebe from the Panarii temple.}
{22801}{The Panarii temple has been gifted with the blessed Jewel of Hebe.  It has been set into a medallion and is said that he who wears it will be loved by all.  We have a buyer awaiting its arrival.}

{22820}{The Thieves Underground would like me to retrieve the Ring of Virility that Mr. Franklin keeps on his person.}
{22821}{It is rumored that Mr. Franklin keeps a ring on his person that enhances his virility.  A gift I'm sure many a man would pay greatly for.}

{22840}{The Thieves Underground would like me to retrieve the potion of dark power from Mr. Fitzgerald's room at the Bridesdale Inn.}
{22841}{We hear Mr. Fitzgerald has gotten hold of a potion of the darkest power.  The underground does not feel it is safe with him and would prefer to care for it themselves.  He resides at the Bridesdale Inn.}

{22860}{The Thieves Underground would like me to retrieve Cassie's jewelry from the back room of Madam Lil's.}
{22861}{Cassie keeps a very valuable collection of jewelry in the back room of Madam Lil's.  We know someone with a bit of a fetish for Cassie.  He's very interested in obtaining her jewelry.}

{22880}{The Thieves Underground would like me to retrieve an experimental engine called The Heron Device.  It is said to be heavily guarded deep within the sewers.}
{22881}{I hear some new kind of experimental engine, called The Heron Device, has been created.  It is said to be heavily guarded deep within the sewers.  The underground wishes ownership of this device.}


//22900 - 23080 Caladon Thieves Underground rumors (1145-1154)

{22900}{The Thieves Underground would like me to retrieve a necklace that is rumored to have magickal powers from the couple staying at The Mushroom Inn.}
{22901}{There is a couple staying at The Mushroom.  They've been overheard bragging about a family necklace with great powers.  The Underground is interested in obtaining it.}

{22920}{The Thieves Underground would like me to retrieve Ryan Sander's pocket watch.}
{22921}{Ryan Sanders carries a rare and valuable pocket watch on his person.  We have a party interested in obtaining this exquisite piece of technology.}

{22940}{The Thieves Underground would like me to retrieve a chest of gold from a wrecked ship south of Caladon before the authorities can get to it.}
{22941}{We have been notified that a ship has wrecked along the coast south of Caladon.  It is rumored to be carrying a large sum of gold.  If you can retrieve it before the authorities do, you will be richly rewarded.}

{22960}{The Thieves Underground would like me to retrieve a suit of Caladon Crusading Armor from a secret armory hidden beneath one of the guardhouses.}
{22961}{A secret armory is hidden beneath one of the guardhouses in Caladon.  If you can locate it, The Underground is interested in Caladon's Crusading Armor.}

{22980}{The Thieves Underground would like me to retrieve Ryan Marshall's police records.}
{22981}{A member of The Underground, Ryan Marshall, has compiled a rather extensive document on his crimes.  It is on file over at the police station.  We would like to obtain it for our own "safekeeping".}

{23000}{The Thieves Underground would like me to go to the dock warehouse and retrieve the post bound for Tarant.}
{23001}{The Underground is interested in the contents of the postal shipment bound for Tarant. It is awaiting a ship in the warehouse on the docks.}

{23020}{The Thieves Underground would like me to find the secret basement in Jonathan Sander's home and retrieve the Staff of Restoration rumored to be hidden there.}
{23021}{Jonathan Sanders has a secret basement below his house.  It is rumored that he keeps a Staff of Restoration hidden there.  We have a party interested in obtaining this item.}

