{42520}{After I dragged myself from the wreckage of the zeppelin crash, I was approached by a monk of the Panarii religion. He seems to believe that I am the "Living One", the reincarnation of some deity of theirs.}

{42540}{The "Living One" is meant to be the reincarnation of an Elf named Nasrudin, a powerful elf wizard.}

{42560}{I received a note from a strange man at the Wellington Gentleman's club in Tarant.  Upon opening it, I found the note contained an address: 57 Mulligan Bone Alley.}

{42580}{}

{42600}{}

{42620}{}

{42640}{}

{42660}{}

{42680}{I have found out that Treat was descended from the Black Legion, created by Zalakar during the Age of Legend. This ancestry is what enabled him to transform into a hideous snake creature during our battle.}

{42700}{I need to deduce the method by which Pollock is able to enter and exit his house without being detected, in order to kill him without having to commit to a suicidal frontal assault on his home.}

{42720}{A fellow with a rather strong stench told me to speak with Muggs, a well dressed dwarf I saw in a bar in the Boil, if I was interested in joining the Clan Maug.}

{42740}{}

