{42900}{I found two dead men in Elder Joachim's room in Shrouded Hills. They were both wearing an amulet with the sign of the eye in the hexagram on it.}

{42920}{Elder Joachim left Virgil a note, telling us to check the telegraph office in Tarant for a message from him, when we get there.}

{42940}{A bloke named Thaddeus Mynor has offered me membership in the "Thieves Underground" if I steal a map of the sewers underneath Tarant from City Hall and deliver it to him.}

{42960}{After inquiring about Rorry Limes at the Tarantian Hall of Records, I found that he owns a building.  The address is 57 Mulligan Bone Alley.}

{42980}{A telegram from the Elder Joachim said that he was investigating the assassins who seem intent on trying to kill me.  We're to travel to the Bleeding Rose Inn in Stillwater.  Once there, we're to speak with InnKeeper concerning how to contact Elder Joachim.}

{43000}{}

{43020}{}

{43040}{A woman I met on the streets of Tarant has bade me to come round to her house at 3 Lungsten Road for possible employment.}

{43060}{I met a strange bloke in Tarant today, a bit of a lurker he was. He told me to drop in on a fellow named Thaddeus Mynor that lives on the corner of Westrel South and Quilton Bend. I'm meant to inquire about some sort of Thieves Underground organization.}

{43080}{After speaking with Gilbert Bates about the possible "religious" aspects of what has happened to me, he has suggested I stop by the Panarii temple in Tarant to obtain more information. It is located on the northern end of Lion's Head Circle.}

